  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3337d858",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### INSIGHTS FROM THE HARMONIZATION\n",
    "\n",
    "- Comprehensive Tracking: The dual unmapped logging approach provides visibility into both directions of the mapping problem - what could not be mapped to\n",
    "  reference standards AND what reference data could not be integrated.\n",
